{"version":1,"key":"card:650","content":{"id":650,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c46b12de-b6cb-457d-bde4-63cdf6b3ce30","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"煤气灯效应，本质上是一种通过长期的心理操纵和精神霸凌，让受害者陷入深度自我怀疑、认知失调的心理陷阱。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"52c1aa6c-c607-41b9-b2da-51e40ebe990a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个词源于 1944 年的经典电影《煤气灯下》（Gaslight）。片中，丈夫为了霸占妻子的财产，故意将家中的煤气灯调得忽明忽暗。每当妻子疑惑地问：“灯是不是变暗了？”丈夫都会斩钉截铁地否定：“灯没变，是你神经过敏。”长此以往，妻子开始对自己的感知产生怀疑，真以为自己疯了，最终彻底沦为丈夫摆布的傀儡。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e3b0830a-b3ba-497b-bb4b-a460567684e0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这种操控的核心目的，就是让受害者"},{"type":"formatted","color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","text":"​"},{"type":"formatted","color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","bold":true,"text":"丧失自我信任"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。当一个人不再相信自己的记忆、直觉和判断时，就只能被迫信赖操控者，任其收割。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"20197c64-c182-4af0-82b3-fb130f1c94ab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在家庭、亲密关系甚至职场中，这种效应往往披着“为你好”或“事实如此”的外衣，通过以下四种经典套路反复上演："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"d750457d-d513-4081-bec6-cedb1f78a289","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c943431a-ecf0-4aeb-8209-d229b47e6d4c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c8970122-621e-4177-b801-301aec16fcb0","children":[{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"全盘否定事实"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"b5a91606-7bd9-4489-b936-e57058d09833","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"0249c767-0f1a-47cc-a924-21cd0e088e75","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ce5a36c6-9803-4f25-831c-878d123a9873","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"“我压根没说过这话，你是不是记错了？”"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"33b2bf96-9111-4ef3-b3fd-8a36eb51d41b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e419f30b-1c91-4c24-9b35-02b62a3e8320","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"“这事儿根本没发生过，别在那儿瞎编乱造。”"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bbfbcefb-effd-4411-8af3-df69b39dc50a","children":[{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"心理演变 ➞"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 难道真的是我记性出问题了？还是我产生了幻觉？"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"076b494e-185d-4ad4-bc60-f1b57e57200a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5e1b5e49-f5ba-479a-82f3-e919ec416abb","children":[{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"疯狂倒打一耙"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"0c52b4d2-a5c0-4467-84d8-1468b33eabf1","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"f95dce7e-3741-40e2-a7da-d19644edf145","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"407b5499-471a-4795-bd65-58c65e40adf0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"“你就是太敏感了，谁受得了你啊？”"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"8c1e9173-9605-4f9c-ae3b-b781e10723d7","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f50e2470-ed8b-45ce-ab69-d907bab53f57","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"“我只是开个玩笑，你至于这么小心眼吗？”"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9bd8fe70-11b3-4bf6-bb7e-bf0f44ff5126","children":[{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"心理演变 ➞"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 好像确实是我反应过度了，是我太难相处了吗？"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"64dfb16e-9dff-46d5-bd19-c1ba56922f2a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"93882426-6341-46ca-a634-05864c8daa56","children":[{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"制造社交孤立"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"79a3615f-971c-4d4f-ae87-f1700106ca5e","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"22038990-37b1-4963-86fd-eec9c74de5a7","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3e3ac820-e6ac-4371-abb1-9f10f48c1819","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"“外面那些人根本不懂你，这世界上只有我才真正了解你。”"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d46dd45e-8616-4bea-8aca-47c7df5fb68a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"10978099-cb3b-4b3a-8bae-9492a0319f29","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"“别跟别人说这些，他们只会觉得你是个疯子。”"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0ce482a3-b15d-49bb-a9b1-562f334d3676","children":[{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"心理演变 ➞"},{"type":"formatted","italic":true,"text":" "},{"type":"formatted","text":"外界是危险且不理解我的，我只能依靠眼前这个人。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"935a7c44-e5d9-4dcb-83a7-b86a0fbef690","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5d3cc5cb-30bd-4397-ba2e-c511ecd0e747","children":[{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"施舍虚假安抚"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"ec15c1b3-db39-455d-b8c8-a661fccfb488","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"f2fbaf37-a289-4e4c-a024-5fca962d6ba0","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dee09a66-b896-4ba8-9867-e7e700c8af7d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"先把你贬低得一无是处，再给你一点微小的“恩惠”。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"be6cd9f8-804b-4503-adc1-dd8f35f4cb0b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3cd7f9b2-6480-49bf-bfc9-5496178003ff","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"“虽然你有这么多毛病，性格又差，但只有我不嫌弃你，愿意陪着你。”"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e8c4e4f3-10b0-4064-bbbf-84e440f87997","children":[{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"心理演变 ➞"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 他对我真好，除了他，恐怕再也没人会要我了。"}]}]}]},{"type":"detail","title":"举个例子","calloutType":"note","open":true,"tauContract":"6f651c7baafe7521ca6995109244b4d914c31407a4c181a83538b42acd722b1e","collabId":"eea49711-080e-4b22-a132-7ee74e31d30c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1cc47395-5bd8-43e3-9d79-d2e7e4a6cc80","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在职场中，这种操纵也屡见不鲜。比如老板可能会对你说：“这个项目明明是你搞砸了（其实是资源没到位），大家私下都觉得你能力不行，但我还是力排众议保下了你。”"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0eade1c1-7f02-4035-aefd-53479b845d00","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果你信了，你就会在感激涕零中陷入自我否定的泥潭，从此对他言听计从，哪怕被过度压榨也不敢反抗。"}]}]}],"tags":["心理学/煤气灯效应"],"createTime":1767094898248,"updateTime":1767140043699,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1767140043699}}